    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "1 The Mews is a well-presented, spacious, semi-detached two-storey house perfectly designed for modern living. It enjoys a private garden to the rear and an open-plan lawn and driveway to the front. This delightful home features estuary views from the main bedroom.\r\n\r\nSituated on an advantageous plot within the highly sought-after Rushbrooke Links development, the property also benefits from a large open green space to the side, a secure gated side entrance, and convenient off-street parking.\r\n\r\nEverything you need is right on your doorstep. This home offers an ideal balance of suburban peace and urban accessibility, located just a short walk from the Ballynoe Inn and Centra Foodmarket. It also boasts excellent transport links, with a regular bus service to and from Cork City stopping right nearby.\r\n\r\nThe property features double glazing throughout and natural gas central heating."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall\r\n4.88 x 1.86m, Timber flooring\r\n\r\nLiving room\r\n3.85 x 3.78m\r\nOpen fireplace, Bay window, Timber flooring\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n4.25 x 5.74m\r\nPorcelain tiled floors, fitted units, including appliances.\r\nDoor to side & patio doors to rear garden.\r\n\r\nFirst floor.\r\nLanding\r\n2.87 x 1.76\r\n\r\nBathroom,\r\n2.41 x 1.77m\r\nFully tiled, wc, whb & Bath\r\n\r\nBedroom 1. (front)\r\n4.24 x 2.91\r\nBay Window & Laminate flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (rear) with en-suite\r\n4.24 x 2.91m\r\nLaminate flooring\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\n2.36 x 0.79m\r\nFully tiled, electric shower, wc & whb\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (rear)\r\n2.66 x 1.97m\r\nLaminate flooring\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nEnclosed rear garden grassed\r\nGarden shed"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Superb location \r\nDriveway to the front\r\nEnclosed rear garden with side entrance\r\nBright spacious living accommodation\r\nClose to Cobh town, Rushbrooke Train Station and a host of local amenities.\r\nIdeal family home\r\nDouble glazed windows throughout"
      },
